        "action:n30"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Simultaneously, the commencement pack and letter of appointment are sent to the candidate. Once the candidate receives these documents, if there is a \"40%\" rate, renegotiation is required."
      ],
      "justification": "b11 (AND) correctly models simultaneity; n28, n29, b9, and n30 faithfully implement document sending and the 40% rate renegotiation trigger."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n31",
        "guard:b10->n32",
        "action:n32",
        "guard:b10->n33",
        "action:n33"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
